#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:79
msgid "Back up database and file storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:81
msgid ""
"Use ``pg_dump`` or volume snapshots to create a full backup to a secure, "
"external location (e.g., S3 or NFS). Validate the backup can be restored."
" See the :doc:`Backup and Disaster Recovery </deployment-guide/backup-"
"disaster-recovery>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Ensure configuration consistency**: Validate that ``values.yaml``, "
"secrets, and other configuration files are version-controlled and "
"consistent across all clusters (required for `Active/Active deployments "
"<#active-active-upgrade-considerations>`__). Use tools like GitOps or "
"configuration management systems to ensure all clusters have the same "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:85
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend performing a dry run by testing the upgrade in a "
"staging environment that mirrors production to catch misconfigurations "
"early."
msgstr ""

