#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:233
msgid "How can I test upgrades without impacting production?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:235
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend deploying a separate staging environment that "
"mirrors production, and running a full end-to-end upgrade simulation "
"before upgrading live production clusters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:238
msgid "Can I upgrade the Operator and Mattermost server at the same time?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:240
msgid ""
"Upgrade the Operator first. Validate it’s stable before upgrading the "
"Mattermost server version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:243
msgid "Do I need to upgrade the database separately?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:245
msgid ""
"Mattermost does not upgrade the database schema by default. You must "
"manually apply database schema updates if required by a newer Mattermost "
"version. Review the :doc:`Mattermost Server changelog </product-"
"overview/mattermost-v10-changelog>` for any migration steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:248
msgid "What if my pods don’t become ready after the upgrade?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:250
msgid ""
"Check the Operator logs and pod events using ``kubectl`` to identify and "
"resolve issues. Look for common issues such as resource constraints, "
"configuration errors, or network connectivity problems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:255
msgid ""
"What version compatibility should I be aware of between the Mattermost "
"Operator and the application server?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:257
msgid ""
"Running an older Operator version may not support newer Mattermost "
"features or upgrade flows. Always check the `Helm chart release notes "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/tree/master/charts"
"/mattermost-operator>`_ for version compatibility between the Operator "
"and the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:260
msgid "Can I automate this upgrade process using GitOps or CI/CD?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrade-mattermost-kubernetes-ha.rst:262
msgid ""
"Yes. You can manage upgrades using tools like ArgoCD or FluxCD to apply "
"Helm changes from version-controlled ``values.yaml`` files. Ensure "
"changes are peer-reviewed and validated in staging before promotion."
msgstr ""

